  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n**Logic: First term × Third term + 4 = Second term.**\n\nNow apply the pattern:\n\nFor, (12, 112, 9)\n\n__**12 **____**× 9**__ + 4 = 112\n\n__**108 + 4**__ = 112\n\n112 = 112.\n\nFor, (10, 84, 8)\n\n__10 ____× 8__ + 4 = 84\n\n__80 + 4__ = 84\n\n84 = 84.\n\nNow checking the options:\n\nOption 1) (12, 149, 12)\n\n__12 ____× 12__ + 4 = 149\n\n__144 + 4__ = 149\n\n148 ≠ 149\n\nOption 2) (13, 55, 4)\n\n__13 ____× 4__ + 4 = 55\n\n__52 + 4__ = 55\n\n56 ≠ 55\n\nOption 3) (11, 99, 9)\n\n__11 ____× 9__ + 4 = 99\n\n__99 + 4__ = 99\n\n103 ≠ 99\n\n**Option 4) (18, 94, 5)**\n\n__18 ____× 5__ + 4 = 94\n\n__90 + 4__ = 94\n\n**94 = 94**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
